Z||000000||Jake_Dragon||03-13-2001||04:01 PM||||<B>Bad</B> thing happened on the way home from the dentist<BR>Started raining while I was still in the chair, when I left the car was handling fine.<BR>About 10 minutes down the road I put on the breaks and nothing happens, Ok something happens<BR>I start sliding toward a large bus. Not wanting to eat a bumper (Literally) I chose to take the curb and bumped a tree. Going to the tire shop in the morning. Scrunched the driver side marker light and Paint.<P><BR>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">   <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://home1.gte.net/rebel33/fiero.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Jake_Dragon (edited 03-14-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||Jake_Dragon||03-13-2001||05:40 PM||||Reality time here! ****  I just wrecked my car! Having totaled 3 cars this has shook me more than I thought.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> <BR>Really sucks sliding towards the back of a bus and thinking this is it, I really got off lucky. <BR>Rain Sucks! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">   <BR> <IMG SRC="http://home1.gte.net/rebel33/fiero.jpg"> ||||reg||11
Z||000002||FieroJoe||03-13-2001||09:24 PM||||I dont know about you, but I really dont consider that funny.  I would be pissed.<P>------------------<BR>AIM: Snowboarder0311<BR>87 Coupe 5sp. - big resto in progress<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||9
Z||000003||Jake_Dragon||03-13-2001||09:46 PM||||Ok it’s 9:45PM you’re right I’m pissed. Luck would have it I can fix the damage and have learned a lesson about my new toy. No more rain driving till I get new tires.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>I was almost killed in a collision 4 years ago and even as much as this has scared me it could have been a lot worse. You know a bumper on a Buss is chest high when you are sitting in a Fiero, could have been a lot worse.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">   <BR> <IMG SRC="http://home1.gte.net/rebel33/fiero.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||FieroJoe||03-13-2001||09:54 PM||||yes, it sounds like it could have been much worse.  Tires with tread = good.<P>Hopefully you dont have any or minimal structural damage.  you probably sheared a few of the front energy absorber pins off.  You can get suitable replacements at autozone if you notice your fascia sagging from the extra weight.  happend with mine.  A lot of work to do though, if you have a lot of ambition go for it.<P>------------------<BR>AIM: Snowboarder0311<BR>87 Coupe 5sp. - big resto in progress<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
